<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; color: #111827; line-height: 1.5;">
  <h2>Invitation to join {{.org_name}} on kr0n</h2>
  <p>You have been invited to join <strong>{{.org_name}}</strong> on kr0n with role <code>{{.role_id}}</code>.</p>
  <p>Use the following invitation token to accept:</p>
  <p><code style="background: #f3f4f6; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold;">{{.token}}</code></p>
  <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 13px;">If you did not expect this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
</body>
</html>
